1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
In 1990, this Shanghai skyline was farmland.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,400
Follow me across the Huangpu River to Pudong.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,100
In about 30 years it grew a wall of towers.

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,800
Three supertall giants now rise side by side.

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,500
The tallest, Shanghai Tower, hits 632 metres.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,200
Double-tap if you'd ride to the top.

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,900
★ Expert Tip: watch it free from the Bund at dusk.

8
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,600
Old Bund or new Pudong — which side wins?
